namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamUICustomMeshSource {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUICustomMeshSource.h#DreamUICustomMeshSource
    src   "UI mesh generator.\nThis class only hold the method of generating mesh, the actual mesh data is stored inside outer class (DreamBatchMesh) which hold this instance."
    text  "UI 网格生成器。\n此类仅包含生成网格的方法，实际的网格数据存储在持有此实例的外部类（DreamBatchMesh）中。"
    state machine
}

DreamUICustomMeshSource:ReceiveGetHitUV {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUICustomMeshSource.h#DreamUICustomMeshSource:ReceiveGetHitUV
    src   "Get uv value on raycast hit point. Normally just use \"GetHitUVbyFaceIndex\".\n@param InDreamMesh The UI element which will use this mesh.\n@param InHitFaceIndex Hit point face id on this mesh.\n@param InHitPoint Hit point.\n@param InLineStart Normally just use InHitFaceIndex and InHitPoint can get the right result, but you can use your own method to do line cast with InLineStart and InLineEnd parameters.\n@param InLineEnd See InLineStart.\n@param OutHitUV result uv\n@return true if hit suceess"
    text  "获取射线检测命中点上的 UV 值。通常直接使用\"GetHitUVbyFaceIndex\"即可。\n@param InDreamMesh 将使用此网格的 UI 元素。\n@param InHitFaceIndex 命中点在此网格上的面 ID。\n@param InHitPoint 命中点。\n@param InLineStart 通常仅使用 InHitFaceIndex 和 InHitPoint 即可得到正确结果，但你也可以使用自己的方法，通过 InLineStart 和 InLineEnd 参数进行线段检测。\n@param InLineEnd 参见 InLineStart。\n@param OutHitUV 结果 UV\n@return 命中成功时返回 true"
    state machine
}

DreamUICustomMeshSource:ReceiveOnFillMesh {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUICustomMeshSource.h#DreamUICustomMeshSource:ReceiveOnFillMesh
    src   "Fill the mesh data.\n@param InDreamMesh The UI element which will use this mesh.\n@param InTriangleChanged Normally just ignore this.\n@param InVertexPositionChanged Normally just ignore this.\n@param InVertexUVChanged Normally just ignore this.\n@param InVertexColorChanged Normally just ignore this."
    text  "填充网格数据。\n@param InDreamMesh 将使用此网格的 UI 元素。\n@param InTriangleChanged 通常直接忽略此项。\n@param InVertexPositionChanged 通常直接忽略此项。\n@param InVertexUVChanged 通常直接忽略此项。\n@param InVertexColorChanged 通常直接忽略此项。"
    state machine
}

DreamUICustomMeshSource:ReceiveSupportDrawcallBatching {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUICustomMeshSource.h#DreamUICustomMeshSource:ReceiveSupportDrawcallBatching
    src   "Is this mesh type support drawcall batching? When the mesh comes in 3d then should not do drawcall batching. Normally just leave it return false."
    text  "此网格类型是否支持绘制调用合批？当网格以 3D 形式呈现时，不应进行绘制调用合批。通常保持返回 false 即可。"
    state machine
}
